WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You've been very vocal about
the Time's Up movement

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:04.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I want to -- I read
something really interesting

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:07.073
about how you reached out and I
think there was a lot of people

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.676
last year around this time
reaching out to one another

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.312 size:88% position:44%
in the community, in the
entertainment community,

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Brie Larson said that when
you reached out,

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:17.484
she kind of realized she didn't
have a lot of peers

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.251 line:92%
that she was friends with.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.854
Was that something that you
found as well that because

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:23.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
how Hollywood works
and how casts work,

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.224 size:84% position:42% line:92%
that you just have less

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
interaction with...
-Yeah.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:26.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...who you would
consider your peers?

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it's this
weird thing where

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:29.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's usually
a girl in the movie.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.932
It's like the Smurfette syndrome
where it's, like, all guys

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.834
and then there's the girl
in the movie, you know,

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:39.172 size:88% position:44%
and so we rarely get the
chance to work together.

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so it was this weird thing
where we had kind of, like,

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
seen each other at a party
or met briefly,

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:48.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, for a second,
but this was the first time

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we were all in a room
talking to each other,

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:54.821
sharing stories and, like,
connecting and working together.

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:58.425 size:81% position:41%
It's been a completely
life-changing thing.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm so happy that
that's happening.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
Also, obviously
it's the holidays.

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:03.129 line:92%
Do you have holiday plans?

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you have things
you're going to do?

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Um, well,
we had Hanukkah already.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right. Of course.
-So that was great.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:11.805
A lot of, um, a lot of latkes...
-Yes.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:12.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...and jelly doughnuts
were eaten.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We made a huge mistake
the day of the first night

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
of Hanukkah, we were like,
"We should order some latkes."

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.846 size:75% position:38%
And then every place
we called is like,

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:20.914 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"Are you kidding me?

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't think the latkes
have been ordered?"

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:26.653 line:92%
-Yeah, that's amateur hour.

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:28.154 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Yeah. That was amateur.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:28.788 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:34.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I had a weird, like,
Jewish holiday thing this year

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:37.730 line:92%
in that, so my cousin, Meryl,

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
moved from New York
to L.A. last year.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.367 line:92%
She's an incredible illustrator

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:42.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she moved out
with her husband,

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:48.374
and so we've been inviting
them to all our Jewish holidays

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:51.444 line:92%
and everything, and then I --

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:54.981 size:88% position:44%
the last three holidays,
she, like, didn't reply,

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:58.451
and I was like, "Did I do
something to offend her?

00:01:58.451 --> 00:01:59.886 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Did I hurt her feelings?

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:01.020 line:92%
Is she holding a grudge?"

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"She's totally not

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:06.192
that type of person, I'm just
going to text her and be, like,

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Hey, you know, we're having
Yom Kippur break-fast.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:11.631 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like, come over.'"

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.566 size:75% position:38%
And so I looked when
I went to text her,

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.970
and I realized I had two Meryls
in my phonebook

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'd been texting
Meryl Streep.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:19.873 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:23.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Oh, no. Oh, no."

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:27.647
So of course, I called and
explained and so my cousin,

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:29.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
Meryl, who's an illustrator,
made me this.

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:32.218
I brought this to show you.
-This is really fantastic.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:33.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll let you read it
for everyone.

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:37.657
-She wrote "Natalie, may you be
inscribed in the book of life

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.159 size:78% position:39% line:92%
and stop texting me."

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:40.226 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:44.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, thank you, both Meryls...
-Both Meryls.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:46.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...for understanding.
-Thank you.

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:49.002
Well, it's just lovely to have
you here. Thank you so much.

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:51.204 line:92%
And I hope to see you soon.

